# Cloudflare Origin CA Certificate
#
# 1. Go to: https://dash.cloudflare.com → SSL/TLS → Origin Server
# 2. Click "Create Certificate" → Use CF-provided CA
# 3. Domain: plexoria.cl (and *.plexoria.cl)
# 4. Download the .crt and .key files
# 5. Place them here:
#    server.crt  — the certificate
#    server.key  — the private key
#
# The certificate expires after 15 years; renew before expiry.
